/** Official platform marks for "Sua oferta. Em cada canal." (#laboratorio).
 * Each mark only identifies the platform where an ad runs: never the
 * advertiser's branding, never larger or more prominent than the ad, never
 * combined with words or other marks into a lockup. Every mark is the
 * platform's own file (YouTube Shorts is the exception: Simple Icons, CC0),
 * with no change of shape or colour. The only work done was mechanical:
 * AI/PDF page to SVG (pdftocairo), percent RGB to the same hex, numbers
 * rounded to 2 decimals, a tight viewBox (the artboard margin is cropped)
 * and, for the marks published only as rasters (Instagram gradient glyph,
 * LinkedIn [in], Google G), a whitespace trim and a proportional downscale
 * embedded as WebP. Sources, licences and rules: /assets/brands/SOURCES.md.
 * Entry: {nome, cor, cores, proporcao, svg, svgEscuro, mono?, fonte, regra,
 * restricao?}. svg is for light grounds, svgEscuro for dark ones. Size the
 * mark with logoSvg() (height in px; width follows proporcao). The strings
 * carry no ids, so the same mark can repeat on the page.
 */
